# oracle: pair_style edip (Si.edip) in a sheared triclinic (prism) diamond Si cell with displaced atoms, 100 steps of nve
# the off-diagonal pressure (pxy, about 1e5 bar components cancelling to about 1e2) is not compared: its cancellation error exceeds the tolerance
# oracle-potentials: Si.edip
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all
# Measured max relative error, engine vs native (thermo rows, final atoms): thermo 1.1e-14, atoms 3.6e-13.
units           metal
atom_style      atomic
boundary        p p p
region          box prism 0 10.862 0 10.862 0 10.862 1.5 0.8 -1.2
create_box      1 box
lattice         custom 5.431 a1 1.0 0.0 0.0 a2 0.0 1.0 0.0 a3 0.0 0.0 1.0 &
                basis 0.0 0.0 0.0 basis 0.0 0.5 0.5 basis 0.5 0.0 0.5 basis 0.5 0.5 0.0 &
                basis 0.25 0.25 0.25 basis 0.25 0.75 0.75 basis 0.75 0.25 0.75 basis 0.75 0.75 0.25
create_atoms    1 box
mass            1 28.06
variable        dx atom 0.04*sin(1.3*x+0.7*y)
variable        dy atom 0.04*cos(0.9*y-0.4*z)
variable        dz atom 0.04*sin(1.1*z+0.5*x)
displace_atoms  all move v_dx v_dy v_dz units box
variable        vx atom 0.01*sin(id)
variable        vy atom 0.01*cos(2*id)
variable        vz atom 0.01*sin(3*id)
velocity        all set v_vx v_vy v_vz
pair_style      edip
pair_coeff      * * Si.edip Si
timestep        1.0e-3
neigh_modify    every 1 delay 10 check yes
thermo_style    custom step pe press etotal
thermo_modify   format float %.15g norm no
thermo          10
fix             1 all nve
run             100
